Z||000009||jelly2m8||10-24-2001||09:40 AM||||Thanks for the replys so far guys. I look forward to meeting some of you, even if I stop to say HI!.<P> 8Ball.  I have contacted both the US and Canadian customs on this, and all I really need is to provide them with a bill of sale stating that the car is for parts, and give them 3 days notice of when I will be at the border. Plus have the money Canadian customs wants to import the car......<P> Thanks for the support guys<P>||||reg||1
Z||000010||8Ball||10-24-2001||10:34 AM||||Cool Deal!!!<BR>Glad it is not going to be nearly as much trouble as I was thinking. BTW I used to live in Nova Scotia. But I was on the other side of halifax from you. I lived in New Glascow/Pictou.<P>Best of luck with the Car and if you happen to be anywhere near Knoxville Tennessee,<BR>Call my cell phone at (865)-454-5333 Be more than happy to meet up with you maybe grab a bite to eat or what not.||||reg||1
